<title>UK: Laporte jumps on BZW &quot;buy&quot; recommendation.</title>
<headline>Laporte jumps on BZW &quot;buy&quot; recommendation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in speciality chemicals producer Laporte Plc jumped on Wednesday following a &quot;buy&quot; recommendation by the company's brokers BZW, market sources said.</p>
<p>The shares -- which have tumbled from a year's high of 723p through the past month -- gained 20p to 686p by 1140 GMT in volume of 506,000 shares.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage declined to commment on the reasons for their recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Langlands, London Newsroom +44 171 542 3496</p>
